Embedder: preserve the host process during library initialization.

ContentMainParams opts out of browser-owned changes to locale, signal
handlers, environment, title, application defaults and CRT state. Native
browser entry points retain their existing behavior. The embedded engine
requires explicit session-bus addresses in its own D-Bus connections, so
it avoids autolaunch without mutating the host environment. The content
shell honors --disable-logging without creating content_shell.log and
appends to an explicitly selected log instead of deleting it.

